{"words": [{"text": "وَقَـٰتِلُوا۟", "translation": "And fight"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "سَبِيلِ", "translation": "(the) way"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "يُقَـٰتِلُونَكُمْ", "translation": "fight you"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and (do) not"}, {"text": "تَعْتَدُوٓا۟ ۚ", "translation": "transgress"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(does) not"}, {"text": "يُحِبُّ", "translation": "like"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ", "translation": "the transgressors"}], "sahih": "Fight in the way of Allāh those who fight against you but do not transgress. Indeed, Allāh does not like transgressors."}